Review fix (T8, test_review_retrieve.py): retrieve() matched symbols across files; share-flag checks
disagreed.

1. 'Same symbol' (score 2) now needs the same file: asking about scripts/a.py main no longer pulls claims about
   scripts/b.py main. Symbols *mentioned* in a question (no file) still match by name, as before.
2. One rule for "shared with agents": share_with_agents is True (a real boolean), via store.is_shared(), used by
   retrieve, export and status. Before, retrieve required True while export and status took any truthy value, so
   a note with share_with_agents "yes" was exported as shared but never handed to an agent. Adds
   tests/review/test_review_share_flag.py.

Apply from the repo root: git apply docs/patches/review-retrieve.patch

